 "那些根本不走路的朋友对我……呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5022.47, "timestamp": "01:23:42", "text": "我住在纳加兰邦的阿尔纳奇，所以我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5024.31, "timestamp": "01:23:44", "text": "我经常走路，所以我觉得没问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5026.149, "timestamp": "01:23:46", "text": "走路的时候，也许你得像那样走路。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5028.79, "timestamp": "01:23:48", "text": "比如15分钟，有时候30分钟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5030.95, "timestamp": "01:23:50", "text": "如果从一个车站到另一个车站"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5032.47, "timestamp": "01:23:52", "text": "但因为它很普通，你不会觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5033.91, "timestamp": "01:23:53", "text": "任何事物。如果你习惯了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5035.27, "timestamp": "01:23:55", "text": "步行是最好的。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5036.79, "timestamp": "01:23:56", "text": "你完全不用担心任何事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5038.87, "timestamp": "01:23:58", "text": "但是，我也建议你去做个周期。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5039.861, "timestamp": "01:23:59", "author": "@gaurdiangaming4603", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mFiZLBZWkzinaMdP6tEYkP1j69A0G3jL01PKtnzXI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "her \"fast as f@wk\" would work as a good advertisement for a phone company"}]